```
Reason:
The patch introduces a switch statement that sets the `swp_inner_l4_offset` only when the encapsulated L4 header protocol is either TCP or UDP. This ensures that the inner L4 offset is only set when a valid L4 header is present, thus preventing incorrect handling of non-TCP/UDP traffic.

